        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/watch/GK9UG24VX/bocchi-the-rock-recap-part-1",
          "overview": "Hitori Gotoh, aka Bocchi-chan, plays guitar in hopes of joining a band. And while she's famous online, what's holding her back is that she's incredibly introverted. That is, until a desperate drummer gets Bocchi-chan out of her shell and onto the stage.",
